/**
 * AZAV provider page (/bildungstraeger/, /en/education-provider/,
 * /kk/bilim-beru-uyymy/).
 *
 * Every fact comes from src/data/bildungstraeger.ts and the page adapts to its
 * state: no certificate number keeps the page hidden (handled by the route
 * files and the nav), no approved measure shows the planned courses with the
 * "not yet fundable" notice, and the GZQ mark only appears once the file and
 * its usage rules are both in place.
 *
 * Legal statements are taken only from official sources. Each one carries its
 * source as a comment next to the copy:
 *   SGB III: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_3/ (§§ 81, 83, 176, 178, 179)
 *   Bundesagentur für Arbeit: https://www.arbeitsagentur.de/karriere-und-weiterbildung/bildungsgutschein
